# The Capacitor native projects (ios/, android/) ARE committed — they hold real customizations
# (DiscoveryPlugin, Info.plist ATS, AndroidManifest, adaptive icons). Their own ios/.gitignore and
# android/.gitignore handle build artifacts, Pods, and DerivedData.
# www/age.js is committed on purpose (vendored, pre-bundled).
# .demo-vault / disposable test vaults are never committed:
.demo-vault/

# release signing — NEVER commit (keystore + passwords)
android/signing/
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
